<title>HONG KONG: HK's Concord Land priced at HK$3.37-HK$4.0 a share.</title>
<headline>HK's Concord Land priced at HK$3.37-HK$4.0 a share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concord Land Development Co Ltd, the proposed spin-off of Pacific Concord Holding Ltd, said on Monday the preliminary price range of its shares to be offered would be between HK$3.37 and HK$4.0 per share.</p>
<p>That represented a discount of 30 to 40 percent to net asset value, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The total assets of Concord Land, Pacific Concord's Hong Kong and China property division, would be about HK$7.7 billion.</p>
<p>It had just completed its roadshow in Singapore which was well attended, it said.</p>
<p>It would start its roadshows to European and American investors this week, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
